 'Повторите правило и свяжите его с ключевым признаком вопроса.','Qoidani takrorlab, uni savoldagi asosiy belgi bilan bog‘lang.','Review the rule and link it to the key feature in the question.',
 'Electrons in atoms','Valence electrons and group properties','{}'::jsonb,'published'),
(1971,'mcq_option','D','Mass',false,'valence_mass_confusion','Valence electrons and properties',
